
Contribution Summary – Ali (Person A)

I was assigned responsibility for the UI design and built the homepage, user/student registration form page, Admin Dashboard, Admin 
– User Management page, Admin – Pending Accounts page, and Admin – All Accounts page using custom JSP, HTML, CSS, and Java Servlet code. 
I implemented the complete student registration workflow, including QC ID front and back image uploads, and
developed temporary backend logic using hard-coded functions so the system runs smoothly without a database. 
The Coach section was removed, and the separate register JSP was eliminated so that clicking “Create New Account” now directly opens 
the student registration page. 
All pages are fully connected through complete navigation.

